<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">d)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">
